<div type="x-milestone" subType="x-preverse" sID="pv581"/><div sID="gen826" type="x-p"/><div type="x-milestone" subType="x-preverse" eID="pv581"/><hi type="bold">7. children of Israel were fruitful--</hi>They were living in a land where, according to the testimony of an ancient author, mothers produced three and four sometimes at a birth; and a modern writer declares "the females in Egypt, as well among the human race as among animals, surpass all others in fruitfulness." To this natural circumstance must be added the fulfilment of the promise made to Abraham. <div eID="gen826" type="x-p"/>